body: "GitHub: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1355\n\nReporter observed unknown_option recovery suggesting synthetic-value as a command, followed by unknown_command, on published 2026.9.29. Equals-form and command-first controls identify context correctly. Current-tree reproduction and implementation are pending.\n\nRequested contract: Every suggested help target is declared in the runtime command lexicon, with a safe root fallback for ambiguous unknown option/value boundaries.\n\nVerification plan: reproduce the public report in a temporary project outside this checkout with both PM roots isolated, demonstrate a relevant regression, then validate the SDK boundary, thin transport where applicable, complete coverage and packed consumers. No implementation is included in PR #1353."
